Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}首先是…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.95,0:00:05.87,CN,,68,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}威基基海灘！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.52,0:00:09.05,CN,,0,700,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}先在這個雕像前拍張紀念照吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.48,CN,,0,700,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}他是誰啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.48,0:00:13.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}杜克·卡哈納莫庫 奧運游泳選手
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.21,0:00:16.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}夏威夷第一個金牌得主
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.02,0:00:19.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}也是出演過好萊塢電影的英雄 還拍過傳記片呢
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.63,0:00:21.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}去之前得先來場電影放映會
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.35,0:00:23.85,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}啊 不用你去
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.85,0:00:26.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}就讓我 千束小姐來接電話
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.46,0:00:31.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不好意思 今天已經打烊啦
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}誰啊 這麼晚了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}怎麼樣 怎麼樣
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.28,0:00:43.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不像
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:44.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}真的？騙人
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.67,0:00:46.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}你都笑了啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.44,0:00:47.59,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我沒有笑
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.89,0:00:50.58,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}你看 像不像
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.49,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不像啦 根本不像
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.91,0:00:50.58,CN,,0,500,0,,{\blur3}Radiata
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.04,0:00:54.21,CN,,0,500,0,,{\blur3}檢測到錦系町周邊有強盜出現
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.21,0:00:55.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們距離最近 立刻…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}快看快看 瀧奈
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.96,0:01:00.21,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}咱們住這家酒店吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.73,0:01:02.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}看 這可是海景房欸
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.18,0:01:02.56,CN,,0,1200,0,,{\blur3}千束
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把指令聽完
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.93,0:01:06.04,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千束
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.74,0:01:06.47,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}這個
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.47,0:01:07.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千束
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.39,0:01:08.87,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}你那是什麼表情啦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.52,0:01:11.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能聽一下嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.03,0:01:12.98,CN,,57,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}那是楠木小姐？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.98,0:01:14.19,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}啊 對哦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.98,0:01:14.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千束
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.19,0:01:17.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}好好好 強盜對吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.94,0:01:21.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我不會殺了他 你確定讓我去嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.35,0:01:24.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}瀧奈 這個好像很好吃欸
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.64,0:01:26.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}好啦好啦好啦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.15,0:01:28.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}她說讓你接
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}井之上瀧奈 是我
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:35.67,CN,,0,1200,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我看看 還有…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}對 不好意思
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.99,0:01:38.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}她有點太興奮了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.63,0:01:40.58,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}你快看這裡 瀧奈
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.58,0:01:43.55,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}是侏羅紀公園拍攝地呢 你知道嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.55,0:01:45.04,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}哇 還有旅遊團
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.04,0:01:47.27,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}就選這個了 必須要這個
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.27,0:01:49.40,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}等一下 我還想吃阿薩伊碗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.48,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}怎麼辦好呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.81,0:01:45.04,CN,,0,700,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}啊 我當然沒問題的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.04,0:01:46.80,CN,,0,700,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}好
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.12,CN,,0,300,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}有任務
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.61,0:01:53.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}目標人物
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.73,0:01:55.22,CN,,57,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}記住了嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.22,0:01:56.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}收到
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.89,0:01:59.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我們出國前還有好多事要準備呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.39,0:02:00.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}趕快處理完吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.17,0:02:04.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}什麼啊 你不是挺有幹勁的嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.47,0:02:07.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}那當然 因為…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.74,0:02:11.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我也很興奮嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.98,0:02:15.85,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}好耶
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.85,0:02:18.00,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}趕快抓住他 然後完成夏威夷旅行計劃…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.96,0:02:21.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把…把錢交出來
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.60,0:02:34.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽見沒有
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.26,0:02:34.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}汪
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.68,0:02:56.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.12,0:02:59.40,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}歡迎來到{\fscx25}　{\fscx100}LycoReco{\fscx25}　{\fscx100}咖啡廳
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.66,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂 好可怕
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.55,0:03:00.84,CN,,0,1000,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}別反抗 脫下衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.40,0:03:01.94,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}乖乖聽話哦
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.94,0:03:04.58,CN,,1000,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不然就會失去某個東西
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.66,0:03:04.99,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 不要啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.70,0:03:05.47,CN,,0,1000,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}好 完成了
